--TEST--
reading an enum case answers the enum's declaration and the read itself, because a case's use is resolved to the enum and recorded there rather than against the case, `rule:ide/five-features-are-one-reference-index`
--FILE--
<?nvs
enum Status: int
{
    case Draft = 1;
    case Live = 2;
}

var $s = Sta<|>tus::Draft;
--REQUEST--
references
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:2:6
case.nvs:8:10
